{"id":"n15304-1-6","stage":2,"title":"가만있다 · 老实呆着","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15304-1-6-1","ko":"겨울 방학 동안 무엇을 했니?","zh":"寒假期间你都做了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"겨울","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}},{"text":"방학","meaning":"放假","explanation":"방학：放假","readings":[{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20207","senseId":"1","lemma":"방학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방학","audio":"/audio/236457354c2107a38d81.mp3"}},{"text":"동안","meaning":"期间","explanation":"동안：期间","readings":[{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70749","senseId":"1","lemma":"동안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동안","audio":"/audio/2aa02e1d6b86b37d7e2b.mp3"}},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무엇을","audio":"/audio/24dedd16c140f1fef242.mp3"}},{"text":"했니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했니","audio":"/audio/1889ab3866856ff3fbae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"236457354c2107a3","term":"방학","zh":"放假","audio":"/audio/236